ucumbers and roasted peanuts.</li></ol></div></article><article class="recipe"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551024506-0bccd828d307?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=85" alt="Chocolate dessert"><div><small>SWEET FIX · 25 MIN</small><h3>Salted Cocoa Skillet</h3><ol><li>Whisk melted butter with cocoa and sugar.</li><li>Stir in egg, flour, and dark chocolate.</li><li>Bake until fudgy; add flaky salt.</li></ol></div></article></div></div></section><section class="section wrap two"><div class="quote">“The best recipe is the one that makes you clear your plate and text someone about it.”</div><div><span class="sticker">COOK YOUR WAY</span><h2 class="headline" style="font-size:46px">Useful rules. Flexible vibes.</h2><p>Find easy swaps, shortcuts that keep the flavor, and recipes that welcome your favorite extras. The result: a kitchen that feels like yours.</p></div></section><section id="book" class="section book"><div class="wrap two"><div class="cover"><small>KITCHEN CRAVINGS</small><b>Crave<br>More</b><span>120 recipes for delicious impulses</span></div><div><span class="sticker">THE COOKBOOK</span><h2 class="headline">Your appetite has excellent taste.</h2><p>Inside: craveable mains, serious snacks, bold breakfast, and desserts with a little drama. Every chapter comes with fresh ideas for mixing, matching, and making it loud.</p><ul><li>120 fast, fun, flavor-stacked recipes</li><li>Easy substitutions and kitchen confidence</li><li>Menus for movie night, brunch, and everything else</li></ul></div></div></section><section id="offer" class="section wrap two"><div><span class="sticker">GET ON THE LIST</span><h2 class="headline" style="font-size:48px">Want the good stuff?</h2><p>Drop your details and we’ll send the current book offer directly to your inbox.</p></div><form class="form" onsubmit="send(event)"><label>NAME</label><input required placeholder="Your name" autocomplete="name"><label>EMAIL</label><input type="email" required placeholder="you@example.com" 